span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 14pt; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; text-indent: -8.7pt;\">관심 있는 학생들의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">일시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">※ 교육 수료 학생에게는 다과(커피교환권) 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">글쓰기 특강 :</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\"> 2023년&nbsp;1월 5일(목) 14:00~16:00</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\"> /</span><span style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif;\">온라인교육(ZOOM)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Batang, 바탕, serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 스피치 특강 :<b> (1차)2023년 1월 9일(월) 14:00~16:00</b> /온라인교육(ZOOM)</span></p><p class=\"0\" 